Text_en:
Abbas Akhundi: Watching TV requires fighting with the ego

In a conversation with #Majidt Farshi; I tried to watch two hours of radio program; The work was very difficult;

No statement on TV makes people hope for development; But under the skin of the city, there is more wisdom and wisdom than the glass of the TV

